[2.333359,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  One running router, eight live changes\r\n  ======================================\r\n\r\n  Start with an ExaBGP neighbor: migrate the actual configuration.\r\n  Then join a running BGP lab and add each feature through SSH.\r\n  Every topic has a proof, a deliberate failure and a repair.\r\n  This is one continuous recording, with no daemon restart.\r\n"]
