[86.346818,"o","\u001b[0m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  Attach validation to transit\r\n  ============================\r\n\r\n  Add the receive binding to the already established transit peer.\r\n  Route Refresh was negotiated at boot; no RPKI binding was in the base.\r\n  Retained routes are revalidated. The external speaker must see one connection.\r\n"]
