[402.276514,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  Protect an existing BGP peer with BFD\r\n  =====================================\r\n\r\n  The lab is one running Ze router and an FRR peer at 172.29.0.2.\r\n  BGP is already Established. BFD is not configured or bound to it.\r\n\r\n  We load two sections in one SSH candidate, compare, then commit:\r\n\r\n    1. Set the BFD detection profile\r\n    2. Bind the existing BGP peer\r\n\r\n  Then cut the FRR link, inspect why BGP leaves Established, and\r\n  restore the link. The shown Ze process stays running.\r\n"]
