[421.306851,"o","\u001b[0m\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  Set the BFD detection profile\r\n  =============================\r\n\r\n  BFD exchanges small control packets to detect a failed path before\r\n  BGP's longer hold timer expires. This profile requests 300 ms packets\r\n  and a detection multiplier of three.\r\n\r\n  FRR calls these transmit-interval 300, receive-interval 300 and\r\n  detect-multiplier 3. Ze's desired-min-tx-us and required-min-rx-us\r\n  use microseconds: 300000 is the same requested interval.\r\n"]
