[1067.462814,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  One VIP, tracking and failover, one Ze lifetime\r\n  ===============================================\r\n\r\n  Priority 200 -\u003e tracked-down Backup 50 -\u003e peer-loss Master 50\r\n  -\u003e peer-restored Backup 50 -\u003e uplink-restored Master 200.\r\n\r\n  Both fault types keep the gateway identity and reachability checks.\r\n  The shown Ze process is never stopped during this sequence.\r\n"]
