[1072.368592,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  Find the source and application behind a burst\r\n  ==============================================\r\n\r\n  traffic0 joins Ze at 10.77.0.1 to a sender at 10.77.0.2.\r\n  A real HTTP server listens on port 8080. Accounting starts absent.\r\n\r\n  We load two sections in one live SSH candidate:\r\n\r\n    1. Enable bounded byte accounting\r\n    2. Observe the traffic interface\r\n\r\n  Then establish a small ICMP/HTTP baseline, generate a heavier burst,\r\n  identify it, stop the senders and check that the totals settle.\r\n"]
